  "releaseNotes": "CC031 now flags Barrier.SignalAndWait in async code. Barrier is not a WaitHandle and has no …Async counterpart, so the previous type map missed it. Zero-timeout overloads still report because the last arriver runs the post-phase action. Look-alikes and synchronous methods stay quiet. 36 diagnostics.",
